contentText:
Jelly Roll has earned three Grammy Awards and a Billboard 200 chart-topping album, and has been inducted as a member of the Grand Ole Opry. His Cinderella story as a rapper-turned-country singer who went from being incarcerated to being a chart-topping artist has become an inspirational story. But could he give all that up if he felt led to?

